+5. If `f.max() == 0` or `field_max <= field_min`, return a zero-filled array of the same shape [S2, S3, unofficial].
+6. Apply the linear scaling formula to each voxel value $x$:
    $$ x' = \frac{(b - a)(x - \min)}{\max - \min} + a $$
